{%- comment -%}
  LUMORA PDP SAMPLE REVIEWS  ·  lu-pdp-reviews.liquid  ·  v1.0
  Paste into: Long Light product template > Add section > Custom Liquid (padding 0), after the formulator
  note. Use this when no reviews app is installed. If Judge.me (or another app) is installed, use its app
  section instead, restyled by lu-skin, and keep the "sample" label. Every review here is written for the
  concept store and labelled as sample content; the summary figures match lu-pdp-lexicon.liquid.
  Scheme: Linen. Anchor: #reviews (the rating link under the title jumps here).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture lu_star -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3.2l2.6 5.6 6.1.7-4.5 4.2 1.2 6-5.4-3-5.4 3 1.2-6-4.5-4.2 6.1-.7z"/></svg>{%- endcapture -%}
<section class="lu-sec lu-s-linen lu-reviews" id="reviews" aria-labelledby="lu-rev-title">
  <div class="container-fluid">
    <header class="lu-head">
      <p class="lu-eyebrow">Sample reviews</p>
      <h2 id="lu-rev-title" class="lu-h2">Tried in late <em>light.</em></h2>
    </header>
    <div class="lu-rev__grid">
      <aside class="lu-rev__summary">
        <p class="lu-rev__avg">4.7<span>out of 5</span></p>
        <p class="lu-rev__stars" aria-label="4.7 out of 5 stars">{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}</p>
        <p class="lu-rev__count">28 sample reviews</p>
        <ul class="lu-rev__bars" aria-label="Rating distribution">
          <li><span>5</span><i style="--w:75%"></i><b>21</b></li>
          <li><span>4</span><i style="--w:18%"></i><b>5</b></li>
          <li><span>3</span><i style="--w:7%"></i><b>2</b></li>
          <li><span>2</span><i style="--w:0%"></i><b>0</b></li>
          <li><span>1</span><i style="--w:0%"></i><b>0</b></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="lu-eyebrow" style="margin-top:28px">What people mention</p>
        <ul class="lu-rev__chips"><li>Absorbs fast · 14</li><li>Warm, not orange · 11</li><li>Layers under SPF · 9</li><li>Took a few weeks · 4</li></ul>
      </aside>
      <ol class="lu-rev__list">
        <li><p class="lu-rev__s" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}</p><h3>Warm, not orange</h3><p>Most glow serums turn gray on my skin. This just looks like my skin on a good day. Two drops and it has sunk in before my coffee is ready.</p><p class="lu-rev__who"><b>Ama</b>Deep skin, combination<span>Received product free</span></p></li>
        <li><p class="lu-rev__s" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}</p><h3>No pilling under sunscreen</h3><p>That is my whole test, and it passes. A month in, my cheeks look more even, especially in photos.</p><p class="lu-rev__who"><b>Priya</b>Medium skin, oily<span>Received product free</span></p></li>
        <li><p class="lu-rev__s" aria-label="4 out of 5 stars">{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}<i>{{ lu_star }}</i></p><h3>Lovely, wish it had a pump</h3><p>The dropper is pretty but fiddly on a rushed morning. The serum itself is great: no scent, nothing sticky, and my skin looked less dull by week three.</p><p class="lu-rev__who"><b>Lena</b>Light skin, dry<span>Received product free</span></p></li>
        <li><p class="lu-rev__s" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}</p><h3>The color is the oil</h3><p>I was nervous about an apricot serum on fair skin. The color disappears as it absorbs, and my face just looks awake.</p><p class="lu-rev__who"><b>Jo</b>Fair skin, sensitive<span>Received product free</span></p></li>
        <li><p class="lu-rev__s" aria-label="3 out of 5 stars">{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}<i>{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}</i></p><h3>Give it a few weeks</h3><p>Nothing dramatic in week one, so be patient. By week three my tone looked more even. I would start with the travel size.</p><p class="lu-rev__who"><b>Sam</b>Medium-deep skin, normal<span>Received product free</span></p></li>
        <li><p class="lu-rev__s" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}{{ lu_star }}</p><h3>My evening ten minutes</h3><p>Sunmelt, Long Light, Haze. I look forward to it now, and my skin looks warmer without looking shiny.</p><p class="lu-rev__who"><b>Marisol</b>Olive skin, combination<span>Received product free</span></p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <p class="lu-rev__note">Sample reviews written for this concept store, shown 6 of 28. In a live store every review would come from a verified buyer or a disclosed tester.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
.lu-rev__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:4fr 8fr;gap:24px 64px;align-items:start}
.lu-rev__summary{position:sticky;top:120px}
.lu-rev__avg{margin:0;font:300 96px/.9 var(--lu-display);letter-spacing:-.035em;color:rgb(var(--color-heading))}
.lu-rev__avg span{display:block;margin-top:10px;font:400 14px/1 var(--lu-body);letter-spacing:0;color:rgb(var(--color-foreground-secondary))}
.lu-rev__stars,.lu-rev__s{display:flex;gap:3px;margin:16px 0 0}
.lu-rev__stars svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:var(--lu-clay)}
.lu-rev__s svg{width:14px;height:14px;fill:var(--lu-clay)}
.lu-rev__s i svg,.lu-rev__s i{fill:var(--lu-hairline-strong);display:inline-flex;gap:3px}
.lu-rev__count{margin:8px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:rgb(var(--color-foreground-secondary))}
.lu-rev__bars{display:grid;gap:8px;margin:24px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;font-size:13px}
.lu-rev__bars li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:14px 1fr 24px;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:rgb(var(--color-foreground-secondary))}
.lu-rev__bars i{position:relative;height:6px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--lu-hairline)}
.lu-rev__bars i::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0 auto 0 0;width:var(--w);border-radius:inherit;background:var(--lu-gradient-sun)}
.lu-rev__chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:12px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none}
.lu-rev__chips li{padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(var(--color-border));font-size:13px;line-height:1;color:rgb(var(--color-foreground))}
.lu-rev__list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
.lu-rev__list li{display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:28px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--lu-travertine)}
.lu-rev__list h3{margin:14px 0 0;font:400 22px/1.2 var(--lu-display);letter-spacing:-.01em;color:rgb(var(--color-heading))}
.lu-rev__list p{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:rgb(var(--color-foreground))}
.lu-rev__list .lu-rev__s{margin:0}
.lu-rev__who{margin-top:auto!important;padding-top:18px;font-size:13px!important;line-height:20px!important;color:rgb(var(--color-foreground-secondary))!important}
.lu-rev__who b{margin-right:8px;font-weight:600;color:rgb(var(--color-foreground))}
.lu-rev__who span{display:block;margin-top:2px;font-size:12px}
.lu-rev__note{margin:28px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:rgb(var(--color-foreground-secondary))}
@media (max-width:1023px){.lu-rev__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lu-rev__summary{position:static}}
@media (max-width:767px){.lu-rev__avg{font-size:64px}.lu-rev__list{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}.lu-rev__list li{padding:22px}}
</style>
